				<element type="warning_sequence">2</element>
                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MODERATE FLOODING POSSIBLE AT WARKON FROM WEDNESDAY EVENING</p>
<p>MINOR FLOODING POSSIBLE AT SURAT FROM WEDNESDAY AFTERNOON</p>

				<p/>
				<p>A flood peak travelling down the Condamine River is approaching the Upper Balonne River after significant rainfall earlier last week. As this flood peak arrives, river level rises are expected, with minor to moderate flooding possible at Warkon during Wednesday.  Further downstream, at Surat minor flooding is possible from Wednesday afternoon. Peak forecasts will be refined as upstream peaks are observed.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Moderate</element>
            </forecast-period>
